      │               ^^^^
    4 │     <MyList v-slot="{ item }">{{ item }}</MyList>
    5 │     <MyTable>
  
  i Inside this element, item refers to the template variable, so the other item can't be used, and the two are easy to confuse.
  
  i Rename the template variable.
  
